WEBVTT


1
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:04.680
Every year we organize a special day in Finland to promote

2
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.960
awareness about installing smoke alarms in domestic homes.

3
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.080
Sadly, most fire fatalities occur in domestic homes,

4
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.080
and we are working to address this.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.000
On behalf of the Finnish Fire Association of Fire Officers,

6
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:21.200
I would like to offer our support for this European wide

7
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.520
campaign to encourage home owners to install smoke alarms.

8
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.600
Smoke alarms do save lives, and I would encourage people

9
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.840
all over Europe to install smoke alarms today.